- `packages/assets/src/fonts/anthropic/AnthropicSansWebText.ttf`,
  `packages/assets/src/fonts/anthropic/AnthropicSerifWebText.ttf` and
  `packages/assets/src/fonts/anthropic/AnthropicMonoWeb.ttf` are
